WEBVTT

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:02.240
Microsoft has established a hard retirement

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.980
date for the old ontology experience.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.760
January 31st, 2027.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.899
That's a hard deadline.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.840
Moving to the new experience creates

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.360
a completely separate new item in

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.700
the workspace. This means data engineering

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.620
teams will have to manually reconnect

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.720
all their downstream consumers, rewrite

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.160
their routing rules, and re -establish

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.220
their automations. It's a hard migration

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.759
cut over, and teams need to

00:00:23.759 --> 00:00:25.020
plan resources for it now.
